                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/5448: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Tenney</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-10-21"><hi rendition="#italic">October 21,
                        1919</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received October 22, 10:55 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>[From Harris:]</p>
                <p>442. October 21st, 10 a.m. Referring to Department’s October 16th, 5 p.m. Omsk
                    Government does not consider incident in question is yet closed. Every effort
                    will be made to investigate this matter and punish those guilty of the outrage.
                    Harris.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Tenney</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
